    {
      "uid": "zhcn:564391dffbd0c1824b98ad0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那孩子脑子转得很快，跑得也出类拔萃。赛事全都是大获全胜——\n正因如此她才显得很开心。……可是，现实哪有那么容易？",
      "source_fingerprint": "525b78e69a7ad18fc8aca7520be35b70e6dcb84a8f74d06e9bf8a07b45b68f95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
