      "uid": "zhcn:cc31df54a794064d7c1889b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园是那些“出类拔萃”之人的聚集地。\n她的战术，也不可能每次都行得通。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae487190d68dd4ea92665b7937ef5642cb3430282729e942465b92fcb7e1e270",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
