      "uid": "zhcn:42e0e2e652ec4248605cfcca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能赢的时候确实能赢。但是，一旦战术没有成功就会惨败。\n……这大概让她觉得很没趣吧。于是就开始耍小性子——",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b87bc668842d84faaf9965e098e59b5c5c35778514eca57b89ef81266be4145",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
