      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你……你、你这家伙…………\n竟然自己主动来这里了……？ 是来训练的吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b182f1f80b692e9e544e2c6b5893ed6f6b0212043ed1ce6f46fdfbfbc81b5904",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
